{
  "name": "Chmod Calculator",
  "short_name": "Chmod Calculator",
  "description": "Convert file permissions between checkboxes, octal (755) and symbolic (rwxr-xr-x) notation instantly, with setuid/setgid/sticky bit support. Free, no ads, computed locally in your browser.",
